---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Info" showLogo>
  <main class="w-sm mx-auto h-full">
    <div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-4">
      <p>Our wedding is on Saturday 26th June 2027</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside leading-snug">
        <li>
          <em class="mr-2">Ceremony</em> 2pm at{" "}
          <a
            class="link"
            href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/XV1HSCgVGFwCbMTC7"
            target="_blank"
          >
            St Nicholas Church
          </a>, BS1 1UE
        </li>
        <li>
          <em class="mr-2">Reception</em> 4pm at{" "}
          <a class="link" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/8ogbUCNmDuMyU1qM9" target="_blank">
            Mud Dock Café
          </a>, BS1 4RB
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Both venues are in central Bristol, with Mud Dock just a <a
          class="link"
          target="_blank"
          href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/St+Nicholas+Church,+St+Nicholas+St,+Bristol+BS1+1UE/Mud+Dock+Caf%C3%A9,+40+The+Grove,+Bristol+BS1+4RB/@51.451635,-2.5964524,17z/data=!3m2!4b1!5s0x48718dd5f8b5b29b:0x5a0dcde1f0f0ba49!4m14!4m13!1m5!1m1!1s0x48718e79cc110307:0x809d8b2dbc05f071!2m2!1d-2.5925655!2d51.4539079!1m5!1m1!1s0x48718dd5fef0c59f:0xdd6f0e6a46f51f9c!2m2!1d-2.5955056!2d51.4492861!3e2?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkzMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"
        >
          10-minute walk
        </a> from the church. We’d recommend travelling by foot , taxi or train where possible, as the church is in a pedestrianised area with restricted vehicle access.
      </p>
      <details>
        <summary class="font-bold">Parking</summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-pretty">There is no parking directly at the church, but there are several car parks within walking distance of both venues.{" "}
          <a class="link"
            href="https://apex-parking.co.uk/car-parks/prince-street/"
            target="_blank"
          >
            Apex on Prince Street
          </a> is a convenient option, and there is also parking near Mud Dock on the harbourside.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-pretty">You may wish to check parking options and prices in advance using RingGo or JustPark.</p>
        <p class="my-4 text-pretty">St Nicks is within Bristol’s Clean Air Zone, so if you’re planning to drive into Bristol , please check whether your vehicle is affected on the government website.</p>
      </details>
      <p class="text-pretty">We’ll update this page closer to the big day with some recommended hotels and our favourite places to eat nearby.</p> <p>We can’t wait to celebrate with you!</p>

    </div>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <a
        href="/rsvp"
        class="p-4 bg-orange-500 font-serif font-bold text-xl rounded-full text-orange-50 leading-none flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5"
      >
        <span class="tracking-widest">RSVP</span> now
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
